      "title": "【复现】C-VIX 中国版 VIX 编制手册",
      "content": "感觉是翻译版得白皮书呢\n\n# VIX计算方法\n\n白皮书具体步骤:\n\n[CBOE Volatility Index](http://www.cboe.com/micro/vix/vixwhite.pdf)\n\n复现中根据CBOE Skew Index做出了Skew\n[CBOE Skew Index](http://www.cboe.com/micro/skew/documents/skewwhitepaperjan2011.pdf)\n\n$$\\sigma^2=\\frac{2}{T}\\sum^{n}_{i=1}\\frac{\\Delta K_i}{K^{2}_{i}}e^{rT}Q(K_i)-\\frac{1}{T}(\\frac{F}{K_0}-1)^2$$\n\nCBOE白皮书对无风险收益率的描述是:\n&gt;The risk-free interest rates, $R_1$ and $R_2$, are yields based on U.S. Treasury yield curve rates (commonly referred to as“Constant Maturity Treasury” rates or CMTs), to which a cubic spline is applied to derive yields on the expiration dates ofrelevant SPX options. \n\n所有在这里我用的SHIBOR利率,具体处理见**GetShiBor**函数\n(ShiBor提取使用了Tushare数据所以需要tushare的token)\n\n结果如下\n\n![Img]( https://image.joinquant.com/f91f3eb9631dcdca783bb71ac7bf2067) \n![Img]( https://image.joinquant.com/36f1dfcf30a4c3dd2b18e214eca273a3)\n\n一个简单的VIX在50上的择时策略如下",
